  <para style="h">Yagebu Huaisan Xin</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yagebu Huaisan Xin</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yagebu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yag</para>
  <para style="mt">Yagebu Huaisan Xin</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1"/>
  <para style="s">Kielien Asazho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1"/>Huda, Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihani hoji <char style="pn">Yagebu</char> xin huaizho. Gochude sandazhi sousan 12 gie paini kunlade kielien asazho. <verse eid="JAS 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2"/>Mii gaijiula, tande yanyanji chijia shiqinyi penjise hende bayasundu. <verse eid="JAS 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3"/>Tai xianxin giekui shiizhi daose rennai irekui ta mejiene. <verse eid="JAS 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4"/>Ta rennaini xiogoni man khizhegha. Ingiese ta fugiedazhi hulunshidene yama ulie chaine.<verse eid="JAS 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5"/>Tai dunda kiende agheli chaizhoshi soyuji kunlade dafande ogizhi ulie kheilaku Hudase xiahua gie, tande ogine. <verse eid="JAS 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6"/>Ta xiahua giekude xianxin giezhi goujida inxin bu gie. Inxin giechen kun haini lan mutun kei matugie feiliese qingie furane. <verse eid="JAS 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7"/>Intu kunla Ezhan yan ogine giezhi bu sumula. <verse eid="JAS 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8"/>Soyuji shiqin jiere zhuyine barei dazhi undanla dazho.<verse eid="JAS 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9"/>Boghoni gaijiula goya undunine kuai. <verse eid="JAS 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10"/>Bayan kunla goya boghonine kuai. Bayan kunla banche jieredu chizhe mutun widane. <verse eid="JAS 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11"/>Naran khizhe nie shase osun ghone, chizheni xiniezhi seighanni widane. Bayan kunye giesan dundane ingiezhi widane.<verse eid="JAS 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12"/>Chijia shiqinyi shoui shidachen kunlade fuqi wine. Shiizhi daosan kunde jianli wo giezhi aminni maghalai ogine. Eneshi Hudade oresan kunlade ogine giezhi dain giesan wo. <verse eid="JAS 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13"/>Kunyi shiise, "Mii Huda shiizho." giezhi bu kielie. Doghunni Hudai shii dane. Hheye kienmai ulie shiine. <verse eid="JAS 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14"/>Kunyi shiise goyani nefuxin miidene miighazho. <verse eid="JAS 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15"/>Nefuxinghala kieli fugiedase zui olune, zui fugiedase fugukui olune. <verse eid="JAS 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16"/>Bi oresan gaijiula, shandan bu gie. <verse eid="JAS 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17"/>Yanyanji gouni, onqienni nenjienlashi man jierese iresan wo. Gonqini Adai hhense irezho. Hhe goujida ulie bienjine, izhi niekielien wo. <verse eid="JAS 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18"/>Hhe goyane isighala zhendaoi tungo giezhi matande ada danlawo. Ingiedene matanyi hhe zhayaghasanla dundadu zui zhunyoni gholughawo.<verse eid="JAS 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19"/>Bi oresan gaijiula, enei mejie, kienliuzhe chenliekude ghujighan, kieliekude lalaghan, hokukude lalaghan. <verse eid="JAS 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20"/>Kunni hokuku Hudai gundanni khizhegha dane. <verse eid="JAS 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21"/>Ingiese yanyanji zannanni, olodosan doghunnilai man benda. Tai zhughede Huda zeilasan kielienni renyide jienlie. Ene kielien tai ruhherni jiui shidane.<verse eid="JAS 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22"/>Ta goyane piendazhi kielienyi zinie chenliechen bu gholudene zunjichen gholu. <verse eid="JAS 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23"/>Kun kielienyi zinie chenliedene ulie zunjise belijide goya uxinne uzheku niekielien wo. <verse eid="JAS 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24"/>Uzhedene yo daose goya yanzine deigo matawo. <verse eid="JAS 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25"/>Zinie kunlade ziyu ogisan onqientu guijinni xianxide uzhedene chenliesei uye matazhi zunjizhi giesan kunlade yan shiqin gieliuzhe fuqi wine.<verse eid="JAS 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26"/>Kun goyane xienlian wo giedene kielienne gonji dase goyane goya piendazho. Ene kunni xienlian yama oronde uwo. <verse eid="JAS 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27"/>Ada Hudai melie ganjin, zannan witu xienlianshi oliechen, guafulade kunnan bikude hhelai zhaogu giezhi da goyane baohu giezhi duyani zannanyi ulie cheiqighakui wo.<verse eid="JAS 1:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kunlade Pienxin Bu Gie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1"/>Mii gaijiula, ta mai famatu Ezhan <char style="pn">Ersa</char> Mexihai xianxin giese kunlade pienxin bu gie. <verse eid="JAS 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2"/>Bilase nie kun antan geizhi zhozhi huaralasan jien musidene tai huitande orowo. Pse nie nanxin kun po jien musidene ye orowo. <verse eid="JAS 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3"/>Ingiese ta hhe huaralasan jien musisan kunde kieliene, "Ene gou wizhi jiere sou." Pse nanxin kunde kieliene, "Chi hhetoro bei, pse mii kon shida sou." <verse eid="JAS 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4"/>Eneshi ta goya kunne pienxin giezhi doghun mujighala pandon gieku pushonu?<verse eid="JAS 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5"/>Bi oresan gaijiula, chenlie. Huda duya jieredu nanxin kunlai sunghudene xinyan jiere ese bayazheghawu? Da Hudade oresan kunlade dain giesan hhe gojiani hhelade ese jienlieghawu? <verse eid="JAS 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6"/>Ta dou nanxin kunlai jiuren gieghazho. Tai qifulazhi fayende lai echisanshi baertu kunla pushonu? <verse eid="JAS 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7"/>Hhelashi ta jienliesan zhiguitu nierei sugiesanla pushonu?<verse eid="JAS 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8"/>Jinwun jiere goyadene mutun giebeidene ore giesan ene nie zui zhunyo guijinni ta zunjizhoshi oluzhoma, <verse eid="JAS 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9"/>kunlade pienxin giese zui fanjizho, guijin ta fanjisande zui jinjine. <verse eid="JAS 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10"/>Kien guijinni man zunjidene niei fanjise soyujilai man fanjizho. <verse eid="JAS 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11"/>"Piofen bu gie." giezhi kieliesan Huda "Kun bu ala." giezhi ye kieliezho. Ingiese piofen ese giedene kun alase guijinni fanjizho. <verse eid="JAS 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12"/>Ingiese ta yan kielie, yan giene giese ziyushighaku guijinghala panjiku mutun gie.<verse eid="JAS 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13"/>Ubali ulie xiichen kunyi ubali ulie xiikughala panjine. Ubali xiiku panjikuse injiwo.<verse eid="JAS 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Gieku Uwoshi Xianxin Giekushi Fugusanni Wo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14"/>Mii gaijiula, kunde xianxin gieku wine giezhi kieliedene yama giekui uwoshi yan zoin wo? Ene xianxin gieku hhei jiui shidanu? <verse eid="JAS 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15"/>Tai dunda gaijiu eghechijiulade niudunie musiku, ijiuni uwokude <verse eid="JAS 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16"/>ta hhelade, "Pinnande echi, musizhi khalun, ijiezhi chudu." giezhi kieliedene beyede injikui ulie ogise yan zoin wo? <verse eid="JAS 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17"/>Niekielien wo. Gieku witu zinie xianxin giekushi fugusei wo.<verse eid="JAS 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18"/>Ingiese niezhan kunla kieliene, "Chade xianxin gieku wine, made gieku wine." Chi gieku witu xianxin giekune made uzhegha. Bi giekughalane xianxin giekune chade uzheghaye! <verse eid="JAS 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19"/>Huda niekozi wo giezhi chi xianxin giese oluzho. Sheitanlaye hhei xianxin giedene ayizhi pugharazho. <verse eid="JAS 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20"/>Chi ene men kun, gieku witu xianxin giekushi yama zoin wituni chi mejieku duran winu? <verse eid="JAS 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21"/>Matanyi xienren <char style="pn">Iburaheimu</char> <char style="pn">Isaghei</char> kewonne sidagha gieku teizi jiere teikude giekughala gounide sanasan pushonu? <verse eid="JAS 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22"/>Chi uzhe, hhei xianxin gieku hhei giekughala hhantu wilie giezho. Giekughala xianxin giekui hulunshighawo. <verse eid="JAS 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23"/>Ingiese jinwun jiere <char style="pn">"Iburaheimu</char> Hudai xianxin giedene Huda hhei gounide sanazho." giezhi kieliesan mutun gholuwo. Pse hhei Hudai zhanlien wo giezhi uruzho. <verse eid="JAS 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24"/>Ingie uzhese kunni gounide sanase giekughala wo, zinie xianxin giekughala pusho. <verse eid="JAS 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25"/>Niekielien wo, biozi <char style="pn">Lahe</char> peizhi ireghasan kunlai jienliedene psedu mo jierese echighawo. Eneshi giekughala gounide sanasan pushonu? <verse eid="JAS 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26"/>Ingiese ruhher witu beye fugusan mutun gieku witu xianxin giekushiye fugusan wo.<verse eid="JAS 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3"/>
  <para style="s">Kielienne Gonjiku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1"/>Mii gaijiulaya, ta olon kunla man loushi danlane bu gie. Loushi danlasan kunyi psedu kunlase gundude panjikui ta mejiene. <verse eid="JAS 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2"/>Matan dajiala go fanmiende cowu fanjine. Nie kun kielien jiere yama cowu ulie fanjise hheshi hulun kun wo. Goya hunshenne man kunzhi gie shidane. <verse eid="JAS 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3"/>Matan moreii amande ghada teizhi hhei hanshiliese hunshenyini kunzhi giene. <verse eid="JAS 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4"/>Pse chonni nie sumula, hhe fugie woma, honfen kei eghizhi chonni gojiolughaliuzhe siji niekozi ga banbaghala fanxianyi goyane isighala suibiende zhanwo giene. <verse eid="JAS 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5"/>Kielienye niekielien wo. Beye jieredu nie ga iyanzi woma, fugie kielien kielie shidane. Uzhe, zui gaji khanliuzhe nie linkoni sideragha shidane. <verse eid="JAS 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6"/>Kielienshi khan wo. Nie gou witu duya wo. Mai beye jiere teidene hunshenni zannanshighane. Dozoheini khanghala mai shenholai man sideraghane. <verse eid="JAS 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7"/>Kun yanyanji yewo, bunzhu, ghughei, zhaghasunlai hanshilie shidane, ede ijin hanshiliezho. <verse eid="JAS 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8"/>Zinie goya kielienne hanshilie dane. Kielienshi ulie beiku doghunni wo, alaku du duruzho. <verse eid="JAS 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9"/>Hheghala matan Ezhan, Adani doulazho. Pse hheghala Hudai yanzighala zhayaghasan kunyi kharazho. <verse eid="JAS 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10"/>Doulaku, kharaku nie amanse khizhezho. Mii gaijiula, ene ese oluzho. <verse eid="JAS 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11"/>Nie bula nudunse qien usu, kou usu khizhe shidanu? <verse eid="JAS 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12"/>Mii gaijiula, uhuago mutun jiere ganlan alima sou shidanu? Putou mutun jiere uhuago sou shidanu? Sou dane, kou bulase qien usu khizhe daku niekielien wo.<verse eid="JAS 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hudase Iresan Agheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13"/>Tai dunda kiende agheli, jienzha wine? Hhe kun aghelise iresan renyitu zhugheghala goude giezhi kunlade zhenmin gie. <verse eid="JAS 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14"/>Tai zhughede hende dubilieku, zisitu zhughe bise goyane bu tungulie. Ghudanghala zhendaoni fandui bu gie. <verse eid="JAS 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15"/>Ene aghelishi asiman jierese iresan pusho. Duya, nefuxin, sheitanse iresan wo. <verse eid="JAS 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16"/>Jien dubilieku sunsigheilieku winetu oronde londaku, yanyanji doghunni gieku shiqin wine. <verse eid="JAS 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17"/>Zinie asiman jierese iresan aghelishi xien ganjinni wo. Pse heqi, renyi, ranji, olon ubali xiizhi gounii gie, pienxin ulie gie, jiani wikui wo. <verse eid="JAS 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18"/>Heqishighachen kunla heqini tareidene gundanni ghurane.<verse eid="JAS 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4"/>
  <para style="s">Duyaghala Zhanlien Bu Gholu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1"/>Tai dundadu sugienduku eghinduku khalase irezho? Tai sudorodu nefuxin khudoghozhi khizhesan pushonu? <verse eid="JAS 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2"/>Ta tanxin giesanne kerezhi echi dase kunlai alane. Dubiliezhi yama kerezhi echi dase eghinduzhi sugiendune. Ta kerezhi echi dakushi xiahua ese giezho. <verse eid="JAS 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3"/>Xiahua giedene kerezhi echi dakushi tai muji ese oluzho. Ta keresanne goya nefuxin jiere injine giezho.<verse eid="JAS 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4"/>Ta ene piofen giechen kunla, ta duyaghala zhanlien gholuse Hudaghala duitou gholusei ulie mejienu? Kienliuzhe duyaghala zhanlien gholune giese Hudaghala duitou gholuzho. <verse eid="JAS 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5"/>Pse ta sumulase Huda matai sudoro teisan ruhherde neiizhi dubiliekude kuruzho giesan jinwunni kielien yama isi uwonu? <verse eid="JAS 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6"/>Ingieliuzhe Huda ogisan nenjien genjia olon wo. Jinwun jiere kieliesan mutun,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JAS 4:6">"Huda goyane undude uzhesan kunlai fandui giene.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JAS 4:6">Goyane meilade uzhesan kunlade nenjien ogine."<verse eid="JAS 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7"/>Ingiese ta Hudai shunji. Ibilisii danla. Ibilisi tanse piine. <verse eid="JAS 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8"/>Ta Hudai shigha. Huda tai shighane. Zuirenla, khane ganjinragha. Zhuine barei dasan kunla, zhughene ganjinragha. <verse eid="JAS 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9"/>Ta yuchou giezhi nango giezhi wila. Tai xiniedunyi nango gholugha. Bayasukui yuchou gholugha. <verse eid="JAS 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10"/>Ta Ezhanyi melie goyane boghonide uzhe, ingiese hhe tai undudaghane.<verse eid="JAS 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kunlai Bu Kielie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11"/>Gaijiula, ta nieniene bu sugie. Kien gaijiune sugiezhi kieliese guijinni sugiezhi kieliezho. Ta guijinni kieliese guijinni zunjisan kun pusho, panjiku noyen gholuwo. <verse eid="JAS 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12"/>Guijinni jinjichen, panjichen zi niekozi wo. Hheshi kunni jiui shidaku, widagha shidaku Huda wo. Kunlai kieliezhi chishi kien wo?<verse eid="JAS 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Goyane Bu Kuaizhi Hudade Kouizhi Gie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13"/>"Enedu, maghashijie matan khalakhala chenshide echi, niehon souzhi meimei giezhi baer zhenjiye." giezhi kieliesan kunla, chenliendu. <verse eid="JAS 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14"/>Ta maghashijie matui gholukui ulie mejiene. Tai aminshi yan wo? Khizhese deigo widaku tuman wo. <verse eid="JAS 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15"/>Ta indan ingiezhi kieliekuni wo, "Ezhan duran bise matan aminne olune, enei giene, hheiye giene." <verse eid="JAS 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16"/>Ingieliuzhe ta goyane undude uzhezhi kuaine. Qingiezhi kuaikushi man doghunni wo.<verse eid="JAS 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17"/>Ingiese kun gouni giekui mejiedene ulie giese zui fanjizho.<verse eid="JAS 4:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5"/>
  <para style="s">Bayan Kunlai Jingao Giezho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1"/>Ta bayan kunla chenliendu. Tai jiere bouzheku zeinande tunku giezhi fugiede wila. <verse eid="JAS 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2"/>Tai boubeila qida oluwo, tai jienlai ghughei ijiewo. <verse eid="JAS 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3"/>Tai antan, miengu xiuqirawo. Ene xiuqi tai zhaku zhenji gholune. Khan mutun tai beyeni sidera widaghane. Ta duya baraku xienzide boubei sunjizho. <verse eid="JAS 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4"/>Uzhe, kunla tai ghazhade wilie giesan gunzini ta ese ogizho. Ene gunzi waradazhi boxin kieliezho. Hhezighan zhonjia ghurasan kunlai boxin giesan shenqi waradazhi Qienwon Buduini Ezhanni chighinde orowo. <verse eid="JAS 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5"/>Ta duyade futande udu daozhi zhomen xianshou giezho. Goyane ijiezhi taghulaghadene alane giesan hhe udude zhunbei giezho. <verse eid="JAS 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6"/>Ta gou kunyi zui jinjizhi alawoma, hhe fandui ese giezho.<verse eid="JAS 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Rennai Giezhi Onxian Gie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7"/>Ingiese gaijiula, Ezhan iretula ta rennai gie. Uzhe, zhonjia kun rennai giezhi eqie udan ghurai panjizhi ghazhase gou taran khizhekui sagheizho. <verse eid="JAS 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8"/>Taye rennai giezhi zhughene khiduzhegha. Ezhan ireku udu ghujinlazho. <verse eid="JAS 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9"/>Gaijiula, ta nieniedene boxin bu kielie. Pse ta panjikui shouine. Uzhe, panjiku Ezhan wijien konde beizho. <verse eid="JAS 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10"/>Gaijiula, ta Ezhanni niereghala kielien kieliesan xienzhilai shouku giezhi rennai giesan yanzii suru. <verse eid="JAS 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11"/>Uzhe, rennai giesan kunlade matan fuqi wine giezho. <char style="pn">Eibu</char> rennai giesei ta chenliezhi daozho. Ezhan hhende zuihoude ogisei taye mejiene. Ezhande ubali xiiku, unbasaku olon wo.<verse eid="JAS 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12"/>Mii gaijiula, zui zhunyonishi fayen bu gie. Asiman, zemin, yanniliuzhe zhiizhi fayen bu gie. Ta kielien kieliekude enbeneshi enbene gie, pushoshi pusho gie. Ingiese tai ulie panjine.<verse eid="JAS 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13"/>Tai dunda kien chijia shiqin penjise onxian gie. Kien bayasuse zanmeishi doula. <verse eid="JAS 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14"/>Tai dunda kien giemerese jiohuini zhanlaolani uruzhi Ezhanni niereghala hhende oluzhi tosun moizhi onxian gie. <verse eid="JAS 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15"/>Xianxin giezhi onxian giekughala giemeresan kunyi goudaghane. Ezhan hhei bosizheghane. Hhe zui fanjizhoshi mienliene. <verse eid="JAS 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16"/>Ingiese ta nieniene zuini renjizhi nieniedene oluzhi onxian giema, tai gien goudane. Gou kun onxian giese zoin fugiede wine. <verse eid="JAS 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17"/><char style="pn">Iliya</char>shi matanre niekielienji kun woma, hhe hende onxian giezhi ghura bu bou giese 3 nienban zemin jiere ghura ese bouwo. <verse eid="JAS 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18"/>Khuina pse onxian giese asiman jierese ghura bouzhezhi zemin jiere zhonjia osiwo.<verse eid="JAS 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19"/>Mii gaijiula, tai dunda nie kun zhendaose likai giese kien hhei khareighazhoshi <verse eid="JAS 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20"/>zuirenyi miisan mo jierese khareighachen hhe kun hhe nie kunni fugukuse jiuizhi olon zuini kha widaghasei mejiekui wo.<verse eid="JAS 5:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5"/>
</usx>
